Error: A subcommand is required
Emit model-free telemetry through the real control-plane pipeline

Usage: wally telemetry [OPTIONS] COMMAND

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help

Commands:
  emit                        Track N events of one modality, flush to
                              /api/v2/sdk/telemetry/{modality} and report the
                              backend's accounting. Production runs the auth
                              handshake first; development is keyless. Exits
                              non-zero when any POST fails.
  blast                       Emit --count events of EVERY modality (all 12) in
                              one run, flush, and print a per-modality result
                              table parsed from the backend's batch responses.
                              Emits one event of every modality.
